<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>autobot k-tp - painel programacao</title><script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script><style>.bg-prata{background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff,#C0C0C0)} .logo-prata{background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%,#fff,#C0C0C0 55%,#8a8a8a);border:2px solid #FFD700}</style></head><body class="bg-black text-white min-h-screen font-mono p-4"><div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto"><div class="bg-prata rounded-xl p-3 flex items-center gap-3 border-2 border-[#FFD700]"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full logo-prata flex items-center justify-center font-black text-[#FFD700]">KL</div><div><h1 class="font-black text-black text-sm">korvil/sok/k-or/autobot/index.html - painel onde programa todas as postagens automaticas - K-TP</h1><p class="text-[11px] text-black/70">autobot para descricao, textos, imagens, videos, musicas, agendar, postar nas redes sociais automaticamente - redes configuradas abaixo</p></div><div class="ml-auto text-[10px] bg-white/60 text-black rounded px-2 py-1">alias: index.hrml - https://github.com/sistemak/korvil-app/blob/main/korvil/sok/k-or/autobot/index.hrml</div></div><div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4"><div class="bg-zinc-900 border rounded-xl p-3"><h2 class="text-[#FFD700] font-bold text-xs">REDES SOCIAIS K-TP - programado automatico</h2><div class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-xs"><div class="bg-black border rounded p-2 flex justify-between"><span>YouTube</span><b class="text-[#FFD700]">@K-TP.p</b></div><div class="bg-black border rounded p-2 flex justify-between"><span>TikTok</span><b class="text-[#FFD700]">@ktp.treinamento.p</b></div><div class="bg-black border rounded p-2 flex justify-between"><span>Instagram</span><b class="text-[#FFD700]">@ktreinamento.p</b></div><div class="bg-black border rounded p-2 flex justify-between"><span>Facebook</span><b>korvil.tp@gmail.com</b></div><div class="bg-black border rounded p-2 flex justify-between"><span>WhatsApp</span><b>13 997690898 / wa.me/5513997690898</b></div><div class="bg-black border rounded p-2 flex justify-between"><span>Email</span><b>korvil.tp@gmail.com</b></div></div><div class="mt-3 text-[10px] text-zinc-500">backend: secrets.GH_TOKEN Node 20 - token nunca exposto - comprovantes assinados igual ML pix korvilloja@gmail.com</div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 bg-zinc-900 border-2 border-[#FFD700] rounded-xl p-3"><h2 class="text-[#FFD700] font-black text-xs">AUTOBOT - GERAR DESCRICAO, TEXTOS, IMAGENS, VIDEOS, MUSICAS, AGENDAR, POSTAR</h2><div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-4 gap-2"><select class="bg-black border rounded p-2 text-xs"><option>programar</option><option>editar</option><option>criar</option><option>agendar</option><option>postar</option></select><select class="bg-black border rounded p-2 text-xs"><option>descricao</option><option>texto</option><option>imagem</option><option>video</option><option>musica</option></select><select class="bg-black border rounded p-2 text-xs"><option>k-tp</option><option>sistema-k</option><option>tecnologias</option><option>k-afortunado</option><option>k-alma</option></select><select class="bg-black border border-[#FFD700] rounded p-2 text-xs"><option>todas redes</option><option>youtube</option><option>tiktok</option><option>instagram</option><option>facebook</option><option>whatsapp</option></select></div><textarea class="w-full h-40 bg-black border border-[#FFD700]/30 rounded p-2 text-[11px] mt-3">{
  "redes": {
    "youtube": "@K-TP.p",
    "tiktok": "@ktp.treinamento.p",
    "instagram": "@ktreinamento.p",
    "facebook": "korvil.tp@gmail.com",
    "whatsapp": "5513997690898",
    "wa_link": "wa.me/5513997690898",
    "email": "korvil.tp@gmail.com"
  },
  "autobot": {
    "gerar_descricao": true,
    "gerar_texto": true,
    "gerar_imagem": true,
    "gerar_video": true,
    "gerar_musica": false,
    "agendar": true,
    "postar_auto": true,
    "usar_token_backend": "secrets.GH_TOKEN",
    "node_version": "20"
  },
  "backend": {
    "token_source": "secrets.GH_TOKEN",
    "secrets_path": "Settings > Secrets and variables > Actions > GH_TOKEN",
    "workflow": ".github/workflows/korvil-deploy.yml",
    "node": "20",
    "protecao": "token nunca hardcode, usa process.env.GH_TOKEN"
  },
  "comprovantes": {
